<title>POLAND: CITIBANK POLAND PLACES PLN 37 MLN OF GM POLAND CPS.</title>
<headline>CITIBANK POLAND PLACES PLN 37 MLN OF GM POLAND CPS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank Polska SA placed 37 million zlotys of three-month commercial papers for General Motors Poland, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said the issue, the third of a 75-million zloty borrowing, was oversubscribed.</p>
<p>The bank gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
